Package: com.minis.statusbarmover
Name: StatusBarMover
Version: 1.0.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Move each status bar icon independently with a per-item X/Y offset (non-destructive transform). Settings pane, live icon discovery, POSIX kill-switch. SpringBoard-only. Constructor does nothing but register hooks; all Foundation work is deferred past boot to avoid the jbinjector early-init SIGBUS. iOS 15.x rootless (XinaA15 / xina2).
Maintainer: you
Author: you
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
